{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the ultra-realistic world of the IVECO Bus fleet with the IVECO Bus Family Crealis Natural Power extension for OMSI 2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since 2022, the IVECO Crealis Cursor 9 NP with its functional, modern design has dominated routes with high service requirements and delivers a unique driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this extension, you'll find the Crealis available in both standard and articulated versions, each offering different door configurations (internal or sliding, with an optional automatic opening feature) to suit all your missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bus enthusiasts will also appreciate the 3 seating models available, allowing for deep interior customization, while the option to install low windows adds an extra touch of realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note that the facelift planned for 2024 is not included in this version - due to the low number of units in real use.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Add-on IVECO Bus Family Crealis Natural Power is a must-have for anyone seeking a truly authentic and tailor-made OMSI 2 bus driving experience. Hop on board and rediscover the joy of driving an exceptional bus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Standard and articulated versions with various door configurations (internal and sliding, with optional automatic opening)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 seating models available in different variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Option for low windows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 interior lighting colors available (white, green, blue, red, orange)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Podium 2 dashboard equipped with the NAVINEO interface and Yard Ticketing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mild-Hybrid option with a Voith 4-speed transmission and Voith NXT 7-speed for the mild-hybrid version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exterior displays compatible with the St-Servan 3.00 format</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576420?t=1742297035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576420/7cfb061e8064f84d1f51978a9a63847cad48a1bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742297035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576420/068e0b2c5888497ec7e9604b505ed31dd092aeb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742297035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576420/068e0b2c5888497ec7e9604b505ed31dd092aeb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742297035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the ultra-realistic world of the IVECO Bus fleet with the IVECO Bus Family Crealis Natural Power extension for OMSI 2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since 2022, the IVECO Crealis Cursor 9 NP with its functional, modern design has dominated routes with high service requirements and delivers a unique driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this extension, you'll find the Crealis available in both standard and articulated versions, each offering different door configurations (internal or sliding, with an optional automatic opening feature) to suit all your missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bus enthusiasts will also appreciate the 3 seating models available, allowing for deep interior customization, while the option to install low windows adds an extra touch of realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please note that the facelift planned for 2024 is not included in this version - due to the low number of units in real use.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Add-on IVECO Bus Family Crealis Natural Power is a must-have for anyone seeking a truly authentic and tailor-made OMSI 2 bus driving experience. Hop on board and rediscover the joy of driving an exceptional bus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Standard and articulated versions with various door configurations (internal and sliding, with optional automatic opening)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 seating models available in different variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Option for low windows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 interior lighting colors available (white, green, blue, red, orange)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Podium 2 dashboard equipped with the NAVINEO interface and Yard Ticketing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mild-Hybrid option with a Voith 4-speed transmission and Voith NXT 7-speed for the mild-hybrid version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exterior displays compatible with the St-Servan 3.00 format</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nerosy"],"fullgame":{"appid":"252530","name":"OMSI 2: Steam Edition"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576420/44d8be2300b3c5fb0214cc2d7cb7746836e68d76/header.jpg?t=1742297035","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2013 AEROSOFT. All rights reserved. All trademarks and brand names are trademarks or registered trademarks of the respective owners. Copyrights are serious stuff. If you find any pirated copies of this software please notify us. We will make sure reports of copyrights violation are rewarded. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAerosoft GmbH<br />\r\nLindberghr